vani. The property boasts a carpet area of 1350 sq.ft. and includes parking. The asking price for this residential unit is 4 Crore. This is a property listing from Majestic Properties.\n\n![2 BHK Flat for Sale in Malad West](/assets/webp/listing-images-missing.webp)\n\nresidential\n\n### 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Malad West\n\nresidential\n\nVORA CENTRICO\n\n2.35 Cr2 BHKUnfurnished\n\nBy **Agent** • 02/09/2026\n\nThis advertisement showcases a premium unfurnished 2 BHK apartment for sale in Vora Centrico, located in Malad West. The property features a RERA Carpet area of 765 Sq. Ft. and is situated on the 17th floor of a 36-story building. Residents can enjoy over 15 amenities, including car parking. The apartment is Vastu compliant and is offered at a negotiable price of ₹2.35 Cr. Interested buyers are encouraged to call for further details and to arrange a site visit.\n\n![2 BHK Flat for Sale in Shankar lane](/assets/webp/listing-images-missing.webp)\n\nresidential\n\n### 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Shankar lane\n\nresidential\n\nCentrico\n\n2.25 Cr2 BHK\n\nBy **Agent** • 25/07/2026\n\nThis real estate listing describes a 2 BHK flat spanning 770 square feet, located on a higher floor in the Centrico project. The property is situated on Shankar lane in Kandivali West. It is being offered as a full package for a total price of 2.25 Crores. This residential unit provides a comfortable living space in a well-regarded area, suitable for those seeking a home in Mumbai.\n\n## Locality & Connectivity\n\neducation\n\n3nearby\n\n* St. Josephs High School\n\n  Nearby\n* Ryan International School\n\n  Nearby\n* N.L. College\n\n  Nearby\n\nleisure\n\n2nearby\n\n* Hyper City\n\n  Nearby\n* Infinity 2 mall\n\n  Nearby\n\noffices\n\n1nearby\n\n* Mind Space\n\n  Nearby\n\nutility\n\n1nearby\n\n* Orlem Church\n\n  Nearby\n\n## Top Agents for Centrico\n\n[![Pro icon](/assets/svg/pro-icon.svg)Add me to this project](/dashboard/top-agent)\n\nNo top agents listed yet for this project.\n\nBe th