artment-for-sale-in-centrico-malad-west)\n* [1 BHK Flats for Sale in Centrico](/mumbai/1-bhk-flat-for-sale-in-centrico-malad-west)\n* [2 BHK Flats for Sale in Centrico](/mumbai/2-bhk-flat-for-sale-in-centrico-malad-west)\n* [3 BHK Flats for Sale in Centrico](/mumbai/3-bhk-flat-for-sale-in-centrico-malad-west)\n* [4 BHK Flats for Sale in Centrico](/mumbai/4-bhk-flat-for-sale-in-centrico-malad-west)\n* [5 BHK Flats for Sale in Centrico](/mumbai/5-bhk-flat-for-sale-in-centrico-malad-west)\n* [Commercial Spaces for Sale in Centrico](/mumbai/commercial-space-for-sale-in-centrico-malad-west)\n* [Office Spaces for Sale in Centrico](/mumbai/office-for-sale-in-centrico-malad-west)\n\n### Properties for Rent\n\n* [Studio Apartments for Rent in Centrico](/mumbai/studio-apartment-for-rent-in-centrico-malad-west)\n* [1 BHK Flats for Rent in Centrico](/mumbai/1-bhk-flat-for-rent-in-centrico-malad-west)\n* [2 BHK Flats for Rent in Centrico](/mumbai/2-bhk-flat-for-rent-in-centrico-malad-west)\n* [3 BHK Flats for Rent in Centrico](/mumbai/3-bhk-flat-for-rent-in-centrico-malad-west)\n* [4 BHK Flats for Rent in Centrico](/mumbai/4-bhk-flat-for-rent-in-centrico-malad-west)\n* [5 BHK Flats for Rent in Centrico](/mumbai/5-bhk-flat-for-rent-in-centrico-malad-west)\n* [Commercial Spaces for Rent in Centrico](/mumbai/commercial-space-for-rent-in-centrico-malad-west)\n* [Office Spaces for Rent in Centrico](/mumbai/office-for-rent-in-centrico-malad-west)\n\n## More about this Location\n\nWhere is Kandivali West located in Mumbai?\n\nKandivali West is a prominent residential and commercial suburb situated in the western part of Mumbai, Maharashtra. It is strategically located, bordered by areas like Malad West and Borivali West, and offers good connectivity to other parts of the city via major roads and public transport networks.\n\nWhat are the transportation options available in Kandivali West?\n\nKandivali West boasts excellent connectivity. The Kandivali railway station on the Western Line of the Mumbai Suburban Railway is a major transportation hub. BEST buses provide extensive local connectivity, and the Western Express Highway is easily accessible, facilitating travel by road. Upcoming Metro lines further enhance its transport infrastructure.\n\nWhat kind of social infrastructure does Kandivali West offer?\n\nKandivali West is well-equipped with comprehensive social amenities. It hosts numerous educational institutions such as Kandivli Education Society's B.K. Shroff College and St. Joseph's High School. Healthcare facilities include Thunga Hospital, Namaha Healthcare, and Oscar Hospital. For shopping and entertainment, residents can visit Raguleela Mega Mall.\n\nWhat is the real estate market like in Kandivali West?\n\nThe real estate market in Kandivali West is vibrant and diverse, offering a mix of residential properties ranging from affordable to premium segments. It is a highly sought-after location due to its excellent connectivity, robust amenities, and continuous development, with strong demand for 1, 2, and 3 BHK apartments.\n\nAre there any new residential projects in Kandivali West?\n\nYes, Kandivali West features several ongoing and recently completed residential projects. Notable developments include Kalpataru Elegante by Kalpataru, offering modern 1 and 2 BHK apartments, and Raviraj Royal by Raviraj Developers, which also provides 1 and 2 BHK units. These projects contribute significantly to the area's modern housing landscape.\n\nWhat are the key attractions or highlights of Kandivali West?\n\nKandivali West is known for its appealing blend of urban convenience and accessible green spaces. Highlights include the Dahanukarwadi area, Liberty Garden, and its proximity to the Arabian Sea. It functions as a self-sufficient locality with a bustling market, reputable educational institutions, and comprehensive healthcare facilities, making it a desirable place to live.\n\nWhat are some popular residential projects in Kandivali West?\n\nBeyond Kalpataru Elegante and Raviraj Royal, other significant residential projects in Kandivali West include Redevelopment of Pushpawadi CHSL by Pranav Constructions Limited and Skylon Spaces by SAI KRUPA DEVELOPERS. These developments offer a variety of modern housing options, catering to diverse needs within the locality.\n\n## Explore Projects in Popular Locations near Centrico\n\n### Education\n\n* St Josephs High School Orlem Malad0.3 km\n* Ryan International School Malad0.8 km\n* Atharva College Of Engineering Malad1.0 km\n* Kandivli Education Societys Bk Shroff College Of Arts And Mh Shroff College Of Commerce Autonomous1.1 km\n* Atharva Institute Of Management Studies Malad West1.2 km\n* Nagindas Khandwala College Malad1.2 km\n* Amity School Of Hospitality1.9 km\n\n### Business\n\n* Raghuleela Mega Mall Kandivali2.2 km\n* Inorbit Mall Malad2.8 km\n* Oberoi Commerz Goregaon East3.9 km\n* Oberoi Commerz Ii Goregaon East3.9 km\n* Oberoi Garden City Goregaon East4.0 km\n* Infinity Park Malad East5.0 km\n* Nirlon Knowledge Park Goregaon East5.1 km\n\n### Hospital\n\n* Zenith Hospital Malad0.4 km\n* Thunga Hospital Malad1.0 km\n* Lifeline Hospital Malad1.1 km\n* Oscar Hospital Kandivali1.2 km\n* Namaha Healthcare Kandivali1.2 km\n* Esis Hospital Kandivali2.0 km\n* Arihant Superspeciality Hospital2.9 km\n\n### Transit\n\n* Dahanukarwadi1.0 km\n* Kandivali East Metro Station1.8 km\n* Lower Malad2.8 km\n* Poisar Metro Station2.9 km\n* Dindoshi Metro Station3.0 km\n* Magathane Metro Station3.8 km\n* Aarey Metro Station3.9 km\n\n### Lifestyle\n\n* Fame Adlabs Kandivali1.1 km\n* Brihanmumbai Municipal Corporation Liberty Garden1.2 km\n* Infiniti Mall Malad1.5 km\n* Savitribai Phule Udyan Kandivali West1.8 km\n* Growel's 101 Kandivali2.5 km\n* Veer Savarkar Udyan Borivali3.6 km\n* Oberoi Mall Goregaon3.6 km\n\n### Locality\n\n* Kandivali West0.6 km\n* Malad West1.0 km\n* Mindspace Malad1.7 km\n* Kandivali Station Area1.7 km\n* Malad Station Area1.7 km\n* Charkop2.4 km\n* M