etro-_300_450.jpg) Mumbai Metro 2026: Route, Map, Stations List, Lines, News Mumbai Metro kick started in 2006 with an aim to improve the connectivity in Mumbai Metropolitan Region. Follow this blog to know about the routes and stations of Mumbai Metro network.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/mumbai-metro/127715.html)\n\n[![Image 94: Salman Khan House in Galaxy Apartments Bandra - Mumbai](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2021/11/inside-salman-khan-house-galaxy_300_450.jpg) Salman Khan House in Galaxy Apartments Bandra - Mumbai The 'Bhai' of Bollywood, Salman Khan is an avid investor. While he enjoys a grounded lifestyle, he owns many properties that add to his net worth. Check out Salman Khan's house in Galaxy Apartments and other places.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/celeb-homes-salman-khan-house/125451.html)\n\n[![Image 95: Harbour Line Mumbai Stations - Route, Map, Timings, Fare & More](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2023/2/harbour-line-mumbai_300_450.jpg) Harbour Line Mumbai Stations - Route, Map, Timings, Fare & More This blog delves into one of the three lines of Mumbai local trains -the Harbour Line Mumbai. The Harbour Line splits into two from Wadala Road, with one line heading to Navi Mumbai and another to Goregaon. Learn more.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/harbour-line-mumbai/131092.html)\n\n[![Image 96: Central Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Station, Timings, Fare & More](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2023/2/central-line-mumbai_300_450.jpg) Central Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Station, Timings, Fare & More The Mumbai Central Line is a very vital suburban railway network within the city, with routes from CSMT to Kalyan, Kasara and Khopoli. Learn the details regarding the routes, stations, train timings, fare structure and interchange points.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/central-line-mumbai/131048.html)\n\n[![Image 97: Mumbai Versova Ghatkopar Metro Route: Map, Stations & More | Mumbai Line 1 - Blue Line](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2023/2/versova-ghatkopar-metro-route_300_450.jpg) Mumbai Versova Ghatkopar Metro Route: Map, Stations & More | Mumbai Line 1 - Blue Line Versova Ghatkopar Metro Route, or the Mumbai Metro Line 1, connects the central and western suburbs. The Mumbai metro Line 1 is fully operational and was one of the first lines to be operational in Mumbai. Know more about Versova Andheri Ghatkopar Metro - also called the Reliance Metro.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/versova-ghatkopar-metro-route/131129.html)\n\n[![Image 98: Yellow Line Metro Route of Mumbai | Line 2A & Line 2B](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2023/4/yellow-line-mumbai-metro-2A_300_450.jpg) Yellow Line Metro Route of Mumbai | Line 2A & Line 2B The Mumbai Metro Yellow line is segmented into two parts, i.e. line 2A and 2B. The Line 2B has recently become partially operational.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/yellow-line-metro-route-mumbai/130113.html)\n\n[![Image 99: Western Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Stations, Facilities, Fare & More](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2023/2/western-line-Mumbai_300_450.jpg) Western Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Stations, Facilities, Fare & More The local train network of Mumbai is the heart of the city. In this vast network, Western Line Mumbai is one of the most important railway lines. This blog provides a deeper look into this railway line.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/western-line-mumbai/131117.html)\n\n[![Image 100: Mumbai vs Bengaluru vs Delhi-NCR: Where Should HNIs Invest in Luxury Property?](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2026/8/FI-mumbai-vs-delhi-bengaluru_300_450.jpg) Mumbai vs Bengaluru vs Delhi-NCR: Where Should HNIs Invest in Luxury Property? India's luxury housing market is set to nearly double by 2031 but not every city offers the same opportunity. Here's a real estate investment guide for HNIs in 2026 and why it matters.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/which-city-should-hnis-invest-in-luxury-property-jymb/151181.html)\n\n[![Image 101: Ready Reckoner Rates in Mumbai 2026-27](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2021/1/rates%20CMS%203_300_450.jpg) Ready Reckoner Rates in Mumbai 2026-27 Ready reckoner in Mumbai is affected by the age and location of the property. Also, I know how to check the ready reckoner rate on the Maharashtra government website.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/ready-rekoner-rates-in-mumbai/118403.html)\n\n[![Image 102: Mumbai Ahmedabad Bullet Train Project: Opening Date, Facts, Route and Development Schedule](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2026/8/Mumbai-Ahmedabad-Bullet-Train_300_450.jpg) Mumbai Ahmedabad Bullet Train Project: Opening Date, Facts, Route and Development Schedule The upcoming Mumbai Ahmedabad bullet train transforms connectivity, boosts property values, and opens new real estate investment hubs across tier-2 cities along its 508 km corridor.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/mumbai-ahmedabad-bullet-train-jkmb/150885.html)\n\n[![Image 103: Mumbai MHADA Lottery 2026: Application Process, Payment Details & Eligibility](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2023/5/MHADA-Lottery-Mumbai_300_450.jpg) Mumbai MHADA Lottery 2026: Application Process, Payment Details & Eligibility MHADA Mumbai Lottery offers affordable residential units for the homeless. The post covers active Mumbai MHADA Lottery schemes, with dates, eligibility criteria, documents, and payment information for the same.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/mhada-lottery-mumbai/132034.html)\n\n[![Image 104: The Rise of Mira Bhayandar as a Premium Micro-Market in the Mumbai Metropolitan Region](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2026/8/rise--of-mira-bhayandar-in-mumbai-metropolitan-region_300_450.jpg) The Rise of Mira Bhayandar as a Premium Micro-Market in the Mumbai Metropolitan Region Mira Bhayandar micro market has undergone a radical economic metamorphosis. The area is becoming a self-contained urban center through better transportation, civic facilities, organized retail, and education, among other factors.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/rise-of-mira-bhayandar-in-mumbai-metropolitan-region/150744.html)\n\n[![Image 105: Bhumi Pednekar House in Mumbai - Inside view, Images, Net Worth and More](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2022/10/bhumi-pednekar-house_300_450.jpg) Bhumi Pednekar House in Mumbai - Inside view, Images, Net Worth and More Bhumi Pednekar doesn’t need any introduction. This blog covers everything you need to know about her lavish sea-facing apartment in Mumbai. Read on.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/celeb-homes-bhumi-pednekar-house/129959.html)\n\n[![Image 106: Asalpha Metro Station on Mumbai Blue Line - Everything You Need to Know](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2026/6/FI-Asalpha-Metro-Station-Mumbai_300_450.jpg) Asalpha Metro Station on Mumbai Blue Line - Everything You Need to Know Asalpha metro is an important station on Mumbai's Blue Line. Learn about its location, timings, facilities and the growing demand for real estate near the Asalpha metro.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/asalpha-metro-station-on-mumbai-blue-line-kamb/149707.html)\n\n[![Image 107: John Abraham house in Mumbai - Inside view, Images, Net Worth & More](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2025/11/john-abraham-house_300_450.jpg) John Abraham house in Mumbai - Inside view, Images, Net Worth & More John Abraham leads a luxurious life in his Bandra West residence. The actor own several other properties in and outside of India. Here's all you need to know about John Abraham's house. Scroll down!](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/celeb-homes-john-abraham-house/130085.html)\n\nLooking for a Property in Vora Centrico\n\nYour Name \n\nEmail \n\nMobile Number \n\nI Agree to MagicBricks' [Terms of Use](https://www.mag