or privy to or control in any manner any transactions between the Seller and the Customer/Buyer/User. All the offers and discounts on this Website have been extended by Read more various Builder(s)/Developer(s) who have advertised their products. Magicbricks is only communicating the offers and not selling or rendering any of those products or services. It neither warrants nor is it making any representations with respect to offer(s) made on the site. Magicbricks Realty Services Limited shall neither be responsible nor liable to mediate or resolve any disputes or disagreements between the Customer/Buyer/User and the Seller and both Seller and Customer/Buyer/User shall settle all such disputes without involving Magicbricks Realty Services Limited in any manner.\n\nAll trademarks, logos and names are properties of their respective owners. All Rights Reserved. © Copyright 2026 Magicbricks Realty Services Limited.","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/vora-centrico/6957/project","title":"Vora Centrico, Malad West, Mumbai - Price Starts from ₹2.26 Cr Onwards | 2, 3 BHK Flats Available","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![Vora Skyline developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/vora-skyline-8998-8094.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Vora Centrico Malad West, Mumbai\n\n![Vora Centrico Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/vora-centrico-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![Vora Centrico Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/vora-centrico-project-tower-view1-9776.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Vora Centrico Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/vora-centrico-project-amenities-features1-1456.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Vora Centrico Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-vora-centrico-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹2.26 Cr - 3.92 Cr**\n\n₹32,050 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why you should consider Vora Centrico?\n\n## About Vora Centrico, Malad West by Vora Skyline\n\nVora Centrico, a luxurious residential project, is strategically located in Malad West, offering a perfect blend of comfort and convenience. With its proximity to prominent connecting roads like New Link Road, Swami Vivekanand Road, and Western Express Highway, transportation becomes hassle-free. RERA approved, this project is a must-consider option for those seeking a luxurious lifestyle in a well-planned community. The project offers a range of amenities, including a well-equipped gym and power backup, to ensure a comfortable living experience.\n\nEach apartment at Vora Centrico is designed to provide maximum comfort and space. The master bedroom walls are finished with acrylic emulsion, adding a touch of elegance to the overall design. The project offers an exclusive range of unit options, including 2 and 3 BHK apartments, with areas starting from 752 sq. ft. to 1308 sq. ft. The prices for these luxurious units start at 2.18 Cr and go up to 3.79 Cr, making it an affordable option for those seeking a premium lifestyle.\n\nFor those looking for a property that offers the perfect blend of luxury and convenience, Vora Centrico is an excellent option. With its prime location, world-class amenities, and well-planned architecture, this project is sure to attract attention from property buyers looking for a luxurious lifestyle in Malad West. So, hurry and book your apartment today and experience the best of living in this magnificent project!**Available Unit Options**\n\nThe following table outlines the available unit options at Vora Centrico:\n\n|  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Unit Type | Area (Sq. Ft.) | Price (Rs.) |\n| 2 BHK Apartment | 752 | 218 Crore |\n| 3 BHK Apartment | 1308 | 379 Crore |\n\n**Nearby Landmarks**\n\nThis premium residential project is strategically located near several prominent landmarks, offering residents a unique blend of convenience, comfort, and modern living.\n\n* St Josephs High School is just 0.22 km away, a perfect choice for families with children.\n* LM Patel Rotary Eye Hospital is 0.18 km away, ensuring timely medical attention in case of an emergency.\n* Dahanukarwadi Metro Station is 1.11 km away, providing a convenient connection to the city.\n* Tri Hotel is 1.11 km away, perfect for guests and visitors.\n* Infiniti Mall is 1.45 km away, offering a range of shopping and dining options.\n* Jaswanti Allied Business Centre is 0.93 km away, a bustling hub for business and entrepreneurship.\n**Govt. Registered Recent Transactions**\n\nThe real estate market has witnessed notable trends in the recent government-registered transactions. Over the past three months, the rental rate has stagnated at 74.437, with the current rate remaining steady at 23,334. This consistent rental rate is reflected in both the 6-month and 1-year aggregates. Nevertheless, the 1-year aggregation reveals a significant spike in sales transactions, with a total of 9 government-registered sales transactions recorded within the timeframe, amounting to a gross sales value of 13 Cr. In contrast, the 3-month and 6-month aggregates report only 1 sales transaction each, with a gross sales value of 1 Cr, indicating a marked increase in market activity over the past year.\n\nThe following table outlines the available unit options at Vora Centrico:\n\n|  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Unit Type | Area (Sq. Ft.) | Price (Rs.) |\n| 2 BHK Apartment | 752 | 218 Crore |\n| 3 BHK Apartment | 1308 | 379 Crore |\n\nThis premium residential project is strategically located near several prominent landmarks, offering residents a unique blend of convenience, comfort, and modern living.\n\nThe real estate market has witnessed notable trends in the recent government-registered transactions. Over the past three months, the rental rate has stagnated at 74.437, with the current rate remaining steady at 23,334. This consistent rental rate is reflected in both the 6-month and 1-year aggregates. Nevertheless, the 1-year aggregation reveals a significant spike in sales transactions, with a total of 9 government-registered sales transactions recorded within the timeframe, amounting to a gross sales value of 13 Cr. In contrast, the 3-month and 6-month aggregates report only 1 sales transaction each, with a gross sales value of 1 Cr, indicating a marked increase in market activity over the past year.\n\n## Vora Centrico Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Vora Centrico.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  752 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.26 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1308 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 3.92 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nVora Centrico's average asking price is rising quarter-on-quarter, compared with Malad West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Vora Centrico | Malad West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 30000 | 30800 |\n| Mar 2026 | 23300 | 30150 |\n| Dec 2025 | 30200 | 28850 |\n| Sep 2025 | 27650 | 27900 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nVora Centrico avg. price is ₹ 30 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Malad West at ₹ 30.8 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Ruparel Mumbai XL](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/ruparel-mumbai-xl/111437/project \"Ruparel Mumbai XL\") | ₹ 36,750 |\n| [Ruparel Stardom](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/ruparel-stardom/246944/project \"Ruparel Stardom\") | ₹ 31,450 |\n| Malad West | ₹ 30,800 |\n| Current Project **Vora Centrico** | ₹ 30,000 |\n| [Godrej Bliss Kandivali](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/godrej-bliss-kandivali/224121/project \"Godrej Bliss Kandivali\") | ₹ 29,100 |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Vora Centrico.\n\nA total of 3 residential transactions has been registered so far for Vora Centrico, amounting to ₹ 7 Cr till September 2026.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Vora Centrico moved from ₹ 23,300/sqft to ₹ 30,000/sqft, reflecting a 28.76% rise.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\nStructural Works reach 86% completion, External Works has reached 90%, Internal finishing stands at 74%, MEP Services including lift and staircases, are now 91% done.\n\nDuring Q4'2025, average property prices for Vora Centrico moved from ₹ 27,650/sqft to ₹ 30,200/sqft, reflecting a 9.22% rise.\n\nA total of 144 out of 416 launched units have been booked as of December 2025, including 2% of 1 BHK(4 out of 185 units), 81% of 4 BHK(62 out of 77 units), 95% of 2 BHK(78 out of 82 units).\n\nExternal Works has reached 80%, Internal finishing stands at 70%, MEP Services including lift and staircases, are now 74% done.\n\nStructural Works reach 87% completion, External Works has reached 75%, Internal finishing stands at 70%, MEP Services including lift and staircases, are now 73% done.\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n3 Sales Transactions Registered in Vora Centrico From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 22.1 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 3 | ₹ 7 Cr | ₹ 22,100 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## Vora Centrico Floor Plans\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 752 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Vora Centrico, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/vora-centrico-apartment-2-bhk-752sqft-20231614141628.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.26 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 1308 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Vora Centrico, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/vora-centrico-apartment-3-bhk-1308sqft-20231714141742.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 3.92 Cr\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of Vora Centrico\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of Vora Centrico to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\n![Vora Centrico Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/vora-centrico-project-tower-view1-9776.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Vora Centrico Amenities-Features](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/vora-centrico-project-amenities-features1-1456.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Vora Centrico Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-vora-centrico-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\nDownload 