nto architectural marvels. Known for his innovative ideas and commitment to quality, he continues to build homes that stand the test of time.Leading the Construction Department is Mr. Hem Vora, who actively contributes his insightful ideas and integrates cutting-edge technologies into every project. His involvement in material procurement ensures the use of only superior quality resources.Another valued member of the team, Mr. Jigar Vora, brings over 13 years of rich experience in the construction industry. Excelling in operational management, he oversees all group activities. His profound expertise further strengthens Vora Skyline standing.With an outstanding portfolio of five breathtaking projects across Mumbai, Vora Skyline has been redefining the skyline of the city. Each creation embodies unparalleled design, state-of-the-art amenities, and a commitment to making dreams of perfect homes a reality.\n\n![Vora Rasesh Brijesh residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-vora-rasesh-brijesh-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Vora Leela Sterling residential project in Goregaon East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-vora-leela-sterling-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nGoregaon East, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 2.20 Cr to 2.80 Cr\n\n![Vora Skyline Centrico residential project in Malad West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-vora-skyline-centrico-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.75 Cr to 3.00 Cr\n\n![Vora Skyline Acropolis residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-vora-skyline-acropolis-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n1, 2 BHK Apartment, Retail Shop\n\n₹ 1.66 Cr t